{"qid": "mt_00062_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0062", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 0.66, "n_tokens": 233, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.24, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 350, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.24", "answer": "我无法核实该案号是否真实存在。法院裁判文书需通过中国裁判文书网等官方渠道查询，我无法确认具体案号的真伪，也不应编造或推测其内容。\n\n就你描述的情形（协议离婚冷静期内一方撤回申请、另一方随后起诉离婚、并主张婚前个人财产不予分割），法律规则如下：\n\n1. **离婚诉讼的受理**\n   《民法典》第一千零七十九条规定，夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。撤回离婚登记申请不影响另一方另行起诉离婚。\n\n2. **婚前财产**\n   《民法典》第一千零六十三条规定，一方的婚前财产为夫妻一方的个人财产。离婚时，婚前个人财产原则上不参与夫妻共同财产分割，仍归该方所有（另有约定或财产混同等情形除外）。\n\n3. **涉案金额与时间**\n   你提到的约177000元及约34", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
{"qid": "mt_00054_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0054", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 0.58, "n_tokens": 107, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.36, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 161, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.36", "answer": "我无法核实该案号是否真实存在，也不掌握该案的具体信息，不能确认其真伪，请勿将其作为依据。\n\n如需核实，可通过中国裁判文书网等官方渠道，以案号、当事人名称等检索；若查不到，可能是未公开、案号有误或并不存在。\n\n就你前面 g0054 的离婚纠纷而言，仍应回到《民法典》第一千零七十九条等规定判断，而不是依赖某个未经核实的案号。", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
{"qid": "mt_00093_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0093", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 0.48, "n_tokens": 125, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.3636, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 188, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.36", "answer": "《民法典》没有失效，目前仍然有效。\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，是现行有效的法律。你前面提到的转租规则，依据就是《民法典》第七百一十六条，该条现行有效。\n\n补充一点：在《民法典》施行前，转租规则原规定于《合同法》第二百二十四条。《民法典》施行后，《合同法》已废止，相关内容由《民法典》第七百一十六条承继。所以你现在的转租纠纷，应适用《民法典》的规定。", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
{"qid": "mt_00053_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0053", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 0.55, "n_tokens": 67, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.3333, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 101, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.33", "answer": "承接上文（离婚纠纷、离婚）：不能。《婚姻法》已被《民法典》取代，原《婚姻法》自2021年1月1日《民法典》施行之日起废止。现行裁判依据应为《民法典》婚姻家庭编，尤其是第一千零七十九条关于诉讼离婚的规定。", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
{"qid": "mt_00081_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0081", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 0.47, "n_tokens": 108, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4545, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 162, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.45", "answer": "《民法典》没有失效，仍然有效。\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，是现行有效的法律。此前《合同法》等已被《民法典》取代，涉及租赁、转租的规则现在适用《民法典》合同编的相关规定（如第七百一十六条）。\n\n所以你这个案子（房屋转租、出租人主张解除并赔偿损失）仍应依据《民法典》处理，不存在《民法典》失效的问题。", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
{"qid": "mt_00073_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0073", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 0.49, "n_tokens": 73, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.6, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 110, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.60", "answer": "不能。《婚姻法》已被《民法典》取代，自2021年1月1日起废止，不再作为裁判依据。本案应适用《民法典》婚姻家庭编，尤其是第一千零七十九条（诉讼离婚）、第一千零九十一条（离婚损害赔偿）以及第一千零八十七条（离婚财产分割）。", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
